<title>
Apron Side Member (Partial) Removal and Installation
</title>
<attention3>
<ptxt>
The figure below shows condition where the following parts are removed.
</ptxt>
<list1 type = "unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>
Front fender: 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLJA0A9A06005"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Hood lock member, apron side member upper extension and forward sensor bracket: 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLJA0A9B06001"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</attention3>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "IFJA0P9B0030.jpg" width = "88.000mm" height = "58.155mm" ver = "01" gw = "227" gh = "148"/>
</figure>
<servinfosub id = "AENLJA0A9B06003001">
<title>
General Notes
</title>
<ptxt>
Welding method and number of welding points are the same on both sides unless especially specified. This repair instruction shows procedure for left side.
</ptxt>
</servinfosub>
<servinfosub id = "AENLJA0A9B06003002">
<title>
Removal
</title>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Drill out welding spots and remove apron side member front plate, apron side member lower extension and radiator support member bracket.
</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "IFJA0P9B0031.jpg" width = "183.000mm" height = "211.542mm" ver = "01" gw = "430" gh = "583"/>
<callout>
<table frame = "all" colsep = "1" rowsep = "1">
<tgroup cols = "4" colsep = "1" rowsep = "1">
